==Restrictions==
Max # of Deployable Cats: 10

==Battleground==
*3 [[Doge]]s spawn after 1.33 seconds<sup>40f</sup>, delay 11.33~16 seconds<sup>340f~480f</sup>.
*3 [[Snache]]s spawn after 16.67 seconds<sup>500f</sup>, delay 10.67~13.33 seconds<sup>320f~400f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Doge]]s spawn after 40 seconds<sup>1,200f</sup>, delay 24~30 seconds<sup>720f~900f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[King's Mimic]] spawns as the boss.

==Strategy==
A very easy stage that any unit can beat. Bring any of the [[:Category:Normal Cats|Normal Cats]] to win.

